# ot_emu step-list verbs 'key CODE down|up' (one panel key edge, the live FIFO's row encoding),
# 'mainlevel N' (SET MAIN LEVEL outside --sequencer) and 'icount [LO,HI]' (the instruction counter and
# frame count; with LO,HI and `coverage` on, the instructions executed so far at PCs in [LO, HI)).
# Applies on top of octabam-ot-emu-steps.patch.
# Session 119 (kyoti-v1): key/mainlevel, used to reproduce and measure the RELOAD [BANK]+[TRACK] stall.
# 2026-11-19 (led-fix): icount, for tools/led_bank_stall.py.
#   git -C refs/octabam apply ../../tools/refs/local-patches/octabam-ot-emu-steps-key.patch
# Build it PRIVATELY (a copy of tools/emu + tools/harness + modules/tapeecho/cpu.c, vendor/ symlinked,
# `cmake -S tools/emu/ot_emu -B build -DOT_VENDOR=$PWD/vendor && cmake --build build --target ot_emu`),
# never in the shared clone while other sessions run its binaries.
--- a/tools/emu/ot_emu/main.cpp
+++ b/tools/emu/ot_emu/main.cpp
@@ -748,6 +748,7 @@
